    live figures will be computed from the stored GSTR-2B/3B responses that
    DashboardController.GSTAnalysis already loads into the ViewModel and
    hands to ~/FRLScripts/Dashboard/GSTAnalysis.js via window.frlGstAnalysis).
    Styles: ~/css/GstAnalysis.css, scoped under .gst-analysis.
*@

<link href="~/css/GstAnalysis.css" rel="stylesheet" />

<div class="gst-analysis container-fluid py-4 animate-fade-in">

    <!-- ============ BUSINESS HEADER — MCA layout: gauge left, then text ============ -->
